  "worked_solution": "Since $\\overset{\u2015}{kv}=\\overset{\u2015}{v},$ we get the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\u2015}{kv} & =\\overset{\u2015}{k}\\,\\overset{\u2015}{v} \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-20+28\\text{i} \\\\ 18-40\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & =\\overset{\u2015}{k}\\,\\overset{\u2015}{[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -5-\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]} \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-20+28\\text{i} \\\\ 18-40\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & =\\overset{\u2015}{k}\\,[\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\u2015}{4} \\\\ \\overset{\u2015}{-5-\\text{i}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-20+28\\text{i} \\\\ 18-40\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & =\\overset{\u2015}{k}\\,[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -5+\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-20+28\\text{i} \\\\ 18-40\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}4\\overset{\u2015}{k} \\\\ (-5+\\text{i})\\overset{\u2015}{k}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we obtain the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4\\overset{\u2015}{k}=-20+28\\text{i} \\\\ (-5+\\text{i})\\overset{\u2015}{k}=18-40\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\overset{\u2015}{k}=-5+7\\text{i}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the second equation, we obtain the true statement\n\n$$\n(-5+\\text{i})(-5+7\\text{i})=18-40\\text{i}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $k=\\overset{\u2015}{-5+7\\text{i}}=-5-7\\text{i}.$\n\nFinally, $\\text{Re}(k)=-5.$",
